      "caption": "Daily Kuliah & Weekly Recitations at Masjid Sultan (2026)\n\nAlhamdulillah, our daily kuliah lineup continues this year — with a beautiful mix of ongoing classes and newly introduced sessions, covering Tafsir, Fiqh, Sirah, Dhikr and more.\n\n🕌 Location: Masjid Sultan Main Prayer Hall\n🕒 Timing: Linked to daily prayer times (refer to visuals)\n\nWhether you’re seeking knowledge, reflection, or a moment to reconnect with Allah, we welcome you to join us and be part of this blessed gathering of learning and remembrance.\n\nBring a friend, bring your notebook, and let’s continue our journey of learning together.\n\n#MasjidSultan #MasjidSultanSG #KuliahHarian #IslamicLearning #MajlisIlm MenaraSultanSG",
